Package: cutter
Version: 2.5.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: rizin, qt5-qtbase, qt5-qtsvg, qt5-qttools, cmake, ninja, clang, pkg-config, curl, tar
Section: security
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://cutter.re
Description: Free and open-source reverse engineering platform powered by rizin
 Cutter is a Qt GUI for the rizin reverse engineering framework. It
 provides graph view, disassembly, debugging, and scripting in a desktop
 interface. Requires Termux:X11 to display the GUI.
